{"id":"d131ef390d6d873892a6f406ccb1d1d16a42c166","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1231011","title":"自从 2026 年 7 月 8 日 AI 角色功能上线，到现在 20 天时间跑了 1.1B tokens","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Livid","excerpt":"Wunder - @Livid - https://edge.v2ex.com/personashttps://edge.v2ex.com/help/persona![]( https://i.v2ex.co/kFC8i","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17921350\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c4ca/4238/1_normal.png?m=1785398719\" alt=\"Livid\" data-uid=\"1\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Livid\">Livid</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>MOD</p><p>OP</p><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 16:19:17 +08:00\">22h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/crocoBaby\">crocoBaby</a> 因为资源限制，目前这个功能其实还没有完全开放给所有用户。目前的最低门槛是：</p><p>- 持有 50 银币<br>- 或者：曾经付费支持过<br>- 或者：持有 10000 $V2EX Solana Tokens</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17921371\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c4ca/4238/1_normal.png?m=1785398719\" alt=\"Livid\" data-uid=\"1\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Livid\">Livid</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>MOD</p><p>OP</p><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 16:23:47 +08:00\">22h 39m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/crocoBaby\">crocoBaby</a> 有些事情确实自己做一遍就开始逐渐理解别人的纠结。</p><p>我现在有点理解 Kimi 和 Claude 有些操作，大概确实是背后的资源的难言之隐，只能优先保证部分用户绝对能用，而无法做到完全放开的增长。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17921405\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/64d6/6ac2/51170_normal.png?m=1784387864\" alt=\"Tink\" data-uid=\"51170\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tink\">Tink</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 16:28:57 +08:00\">22h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我现在都不敢用，一用就 token 就爆了哈哈</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17921435\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7f7f/3bb4/531733_normal.png?m=1784862706\" alt=\"JoeJoeJoe\" data-uid=\"531733\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JoeJoeJoe\">JoeJoeJoe</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-30 16:33:50 +08:00\">22h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>所以中转站是版本答案, 开放一个 p2p 的中转, 让 token 流动起来.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17921456\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c4ca/4238/1_normal.png?m=1785398719\" alt=\"Livid\" data-uid=\"1\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n        